    "Foldwall": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Foldwall 以 MIT 授權釋出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foldwall is released under the MIT license."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foldwall 以 MIT 授權釋出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foldwall 自己不讀、不存、也不傳送任何 cookie——只是把「去哪個瀏覽器拿」這個選擇交給 yt-dlp，讀取跟使用都發生在它的行程裡，全程在這台電腦上。設定裡存下來的只有瀏覽器的名字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foldwall never reads, stores, or transmits a single cookie. It only passes your choice of browser to yt-dlp; the reading and the using both happen inside that process, entirely on this Mac. All that is saved here is the name of a browser."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foldwall 自己不讀、不存、也不傳送任何 cookie——只是把「去哪個瀏覽器拿」這個選擇交給 yt-dlp，讀取跟使用都發生在它的行程裡，全程在這台電腦上。設定裡存下來的只有瀏覽器的名字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foldwall 需要讀取權限才能把相簿當成桌布來源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foldwall needs read access before it can use albums as a wallpaper source."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foldwall 需要讀取權限才能把相簿當成桌布來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RSS／Atom feed 的網址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The URL of an RSS or Atom feed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RSS／Atom feed 的網址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Safari 的 cookie 放在系統保護的位置。要授權的是 **Foldwall**，不是 yt-dlp——子行程的授權判定歸屬於把它叫起來的那個 app。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safari keeps its cookies in a system-protected location. The app that needs permission is **Foldwall**, not yt-dlp: a child process is judged by whichever app launched it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safari 的 cookie 放在系統保護的位置。要授權的是 **Foldwall**，不是 yt-dlp——子行程的授權判定歸屬於把它叫起來的那個 app。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallhaven 的公開內容**不需要 key**，直接用就行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wallhaven’s public content **needs no key** — just use it."
