    "「備份到 iCloud」會寫兩層；「更新來源」只拉共用的那層，不會動這台的桌布設定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Back up to iCloud” writes both layers. “Update sources” pulls only the shared layer and leaves this Mac's wallpaper settings alone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
