    "作者印在每張照片的相紙下緣；相紙太小放不下的，收到右下角一起列。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The credit is printed along the bottom edge of each photo’s print; prints too small to hold one are listed together in the bottom-right corner."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作者印在每張照片的相紙下緣；相紙太小放不下的，收到右下角一起列。"
