    "內容": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contents"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "兩層": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two layers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "兩組都在 ~/Library/Caches 底下，磁碟空間不足時 macOS 會自己刪。Foldwall 會重新下載，但螢幕保護程式那邊會暫時沒圖可播。目前掛在桌面上的桌布放在 Application Support，不會被清掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both live under ~/Library/Caches, so macOS deletes them on its own when disk space runs low. Foldwall re-downloads, but the screen saver has nothing to play in the meantime. The wallpaper currently on your desktop lives in Application Support and is never purged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩組都在 ~/Library/Caches 底下，磁碟空間不足時 macOS 會自己刪。Foldwall 會重新下載，但螢幕保護程式那邊會暫時沒圖可播。目前掛在桌面上的桌布放在 Application Support，不會被清掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切換間隔": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change interval"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切換間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切換間隔、後製、同時抽取張數、影片引擎／圖層／播放／縮放／畫質、狀態規則、登入時啟動——全部各台各自一份，寫在 `devices/` 底下以機器命名的檔案裡，**只有同一台會自動讀回來**。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interval, effect, pieces per round, video engine / layer / playback / scaling / quality, state rules, launch at login — each Mac keeps its own copy in a file named after it under `devices/`, and **only that same Mac reads it back automatically**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前往申請（免費）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign up (free)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往申請（免費）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加入一個有照片的資料夾就會開始輪播。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a folder with photos in it and the rotation starts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
