          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名稱（選填）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和蒙太奇共用同一批來源資料夾，這裡只決定哪些拿來放影片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shares the same source folders as the montage; this only decides which ones supply video."
          }
