      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable video wallpaper"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "啟用影片桌布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回到選單列，勾 **此螢幕改用影片**。漏掉這步，下一輪靜態蒙太奇會把影片蓋掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back in the menu bar, check **Use Video on This Display**. Skip this and the next static montage will paint over the video."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回到選單列，勾 **此螢幕改用影片**。漏掉這步，下一輪靜態蒙太奇會把影片蓋掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回應格式不符": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unexpected response format"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回應格式不符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回選單列勾 **此螢幕改用影片**。就這樣——不必開系統設定、不會拷貝任何檔案。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back in the menu bar, check **Use Video on This Display**. That is all — no System Settings, no files copied."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回選單列勾 **此螢幕改用影片**。就這樣——不必開系統設定、不會拷貝任何檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
