    },
    "在 Wallhaven 帳號設定頁面最下方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the bottom of your Wallhaven account settings page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Wallhaven 帳號設定頁面最下方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在「完全取用磁碟」裡把 Foldwall 打開，然後回來再測一次。清單裡沒有 Foldwall 的話，用左下角的 ＋ 從「應用程式」裡加進去。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch Foldwall on under Full Disk Access, then come back and test again. If Foldwall is not in the list, add it from Applications with the + button at the bottom left."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「完全取用磁碟」裡把 Foldwall 打開，然後回來再測一次。清單裡沒有 Foldwall 的話，用左下角的 ＋ 從「應用程式」裡加進去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在你自己的 Immich：帳號設定 → API Keys → 新增。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On your own Immich: Account Settings → API Keys → New."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你自己的 Immich：帳號設定 → API Keys → 新增。"
