    "從資料夾、照片相簿與免 OAuth 的網路來源隨機合成蒙太奇桌布，並支援影片桌布（桌面＋鎖屏）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Builds random montage wallpapers from folders, photo albums and OAuth-free web sources, and can play video wallpaper on the desktop and lock screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從資料夾、照片相簿與免 OAuth 的網路來源隨機合成蒙太奇桌布，並支援影片桌布（桌面＋鎖屏）。"
