    "打開上面的**啟用影片桌布**開關，在「來源」分頁加入含影片的資料夾，並在左欄勾選要用的來源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on **Enable video wallpaper** above, add a folder containing videos in the Sources tab, and check the sources you want in the left column."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開上面的**啟用影片桌布**開關，在「來源」分頁加入含影片的資料夾，並在左欄勾選要用的來源。"
