            "state": "translated",
            "value": "池 %lld 張"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒有 ffmpeg——`brew install ffmpeg`。YouTube 這類站只提供分離的視訊／音訊軌，沒有它就合併不了，片單一支也抓不下來。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No ffmpeg — `brew install ffmpeg`. Sites like YouTube only serve separate video and audio tracks; without it they cannot be merged, and not a single playlist video will download."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有 ffmpeg——`brew install ffmpeg`。YouTube 這類站只提供分離的視訊／音訊軌，沒有它就合併不了，片單一支也抓不下來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒有可用的相簿": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No usable albums"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有可用的相簿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒有規則": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沙盒 extension 讀不到 app 的來源資料夾，影片必須**實體拷貝**一份進去。來源若是 NAS，那會是幾十 GB——所以預設關閉，而且採**輪替**而非囤積：一次帶到**填滿 %lld GB** 為止（幾支視大小而定）。下次螢幕亮起換一批，但**只換四分之一**——重疊的部分不必重拷，每輪從來源搬動的量因此是 %lld MB 而不是 %lld GB。整個片庫照樣輪得到，只是慢一些。單檔超過 %lld GB 一律不收——那是片庫內容，不是桌布循環素材。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A sandboxed extension cannot read the app’s source folders, so videos must be **physically copied** into it. From a NAS that would be tens of GB — which is why this is off by default and why it **rotates** rather than hoards: each pass takes videos until **%1$lld GB is full** (how many depends on their size). The next time the display wakes it swaps a batch, but **only a quarter of it** — the overlap is not re-copied, so each pass moves %2$lld MB from the source instead of %3$lld GB. The whole library still comes around, just more slowly. Any single file over %4$lld GB is never taken — that is library material, not wallpaper loop material."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沙盒 extension 讀不到 app 的來源資料夾，影片必須**實體拷貝**一份進去。來源若是 NAS，那會是幾十 GB——所以預設關閉，而且採**輪替**而非囤積：一次帶到**填滿 %1$lld GB** 為止（幾支視大小而定）。下次螢幕亮起換一批，但**只換四分之一**——重疊的部分不必重拷，每輪從來源搬動的量因此是 %2$lld MB 而不是 %3$lld GB。整個片庫照樣輪得到，只是慢一些。單檔超過 %4$lld GB 一律不收——那是片庫內容，不是桌布循環素材。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清完**不會立刻重新下載**，等下一個排程輪次自然補回來。目前掛在桌面上的桌布不受影響。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing is **re-downloaded immediately** — the next scheduled pass refills it. The wallpaper currently on your desktop is unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清完**不會立刻重新下載**，等下一個排程輪次自然補回來。目前掛在桌面上的桌布不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
