    "片單解析與下載都靠它。安裝後回來按「重新解析」：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both playlist resolution and downloads depend on it. Install it, then come back and press Resolve Again:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片單解析與下載都靠它。安裝後回來按「重新解析」："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "片單解析與影片下載都是呼叫**你自己安裝的 yt-dlp**，Foldwall 不實作任何串流解析或簽章繞過——那是規避技術保護措施。這裡只負責找到工具、組出參數、把結果收進影片來源；要對哪個站用由你決定。\n順帶的好處是 yt-dlp 支援上千個站，不必為每一個寫解析器；代價是**沒裝就用不了**這兩個功能，其他來源不受影響。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Playlist resolution and video downloads both call **the yt-dlp you installed yourself**. Foldwall implements no stream parsing and no signature bypass — that would be circumvention of technical protection measures. All it does is locate the tool, assemble the arguments and take the result in as a video source; which sites you point it at is your call.\nA side benefit is that yt-dlp supports thousands of sites, so no per-site parser is needed here; the cost is that **without it these two features do not work**, while every other source is unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片單解析與影片下載都是呼叫**你自己安裝的 yt-dlp**，Foldwall 不實作任何串流解析或簽章繞過——那是規避技術保護措施。這裡只負責找到工具、組出參數、把結果收進影片來源；要對哪個站用由你決定。\n順帶的好處是 yt-dlp 支援上千個站，不必為每一個寫解析器；代價是**沒裝就用不了**這兩個功能，其他來源不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
