    "讀不到系統的專注模式清單。macOS 沒有公開 API 可查詢目前是哪個模式，Foldwall 讀的是 ~/Library/DoNotDisturb/DB/——格式若隨系統更新改變，專注模式的規則會靜默失效，其他功能不受影響。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system’s Focus list could not be read. macOS has no public API for querying the current Focus, so Foldwall reads ~/Library/DoNotDisturb/DB/ — if a system update changes that format, Focus rules fail silently while everything else keeps working."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讀不到系統的專注模式清單。macOS 沒有公開 API 可查詢目前是哪個模式，Foldwall 讀的是 ~/Library/DoNotDisturb/DB/——格式若隨系統更新改變，專注模式的規則會靜默失效，其他功能不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀不到（未掛載或無權限）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unreadable (not mounted, or no permission)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讀不到（未掛載或無權限）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀到 %lld 個 cookie。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read %lld cookies."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讀到 %lld 個 cookie。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀到 %lld 個 cookie，這支目前會拿到 %@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read %1$lld cookies. This video currently resolves to %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "讀到 %1$lld 個 cookie，這支目前會拿到 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀取「%@」的設定失敗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't read the settings from “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀取來源目錄失敗：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't read the source catalog: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "資料夾": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folders"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "資料夾 %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld folders"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料夾 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "資料夾、網路來源、片單的**定義**寫在共用的 `sources.json`。在一台加的來源，別台也會出現；在一台刪掉的，別台也會清掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The **definitions** of folders, network sources and playlists live in a shared `sources.json`. Add a source on one Mac and it shows up on the others; delete it on one and it clears everywhere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "資料夾書籤": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folder bookmarks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "輪到第幾支影片了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which video is up next"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "輪替中的影片會被移除，影片螢幕暫由蒙太奇接管，下次螢幕睡著時再預先拷一批。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The videos in this rotation are removed, the montage takes over those displays for now, and a fresh batch is copied the next time the display sleeps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "輪替中的影片會被移除，影片螢幕暫由蒙太奇接管，下次螢幕睡著時再預先拷一批。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這一頁只確認設定填對、連得上。要不要拿它合成蒙太奇或當影片來源，在「蒙太奇桌布」／「影片桌布」分頁勾選。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This page only confirms the settings are right and the source is reachable. Whether it feeds the montage or supplies video is checked in the Montage and Video tabs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一頁只確認設定填對、連得上。要不要拿它合成蒙太奇或當影片來源，在「蒙太奇桌布」／「影片桌布」分頁勾選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這一頁只管來源設好了沒、讀不讀得到。要拿哪些來源合成蒙太奇、哪些放影片，在「蒙太奇桌布」和「影片桌布」分頁決定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This page only covers whether a source is set up and readable. Which sources feed the montage and which supply video is decided in the Montage and Video tabs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一頁只管來源設好了沒、讀不讀得到。要拿哪些來源合成蒙太奇、哪些放影片，在「蒙太奇桌布」和「影片桌布」分頁決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個網址裡沒有可用的影片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No usable videos at this URL"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個網址裡沒有可用的影片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台機器上沒有它的 cookie 資料庫——多半是沒裝，或裝了但還沒開過。先開一次那個瀏覽器並登入要抓的站，再回來測。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no cookie database for it on this Mac — most likely it is not installed, or it is but has never been opened. Launch that browser once, sign in to the site you want, then test again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台機器上沒有它的 cookie 資料庫——多半是沒裝，或裝了但還沒開過。先開一次那個瀏覽器並登入要抓的站，再回來測。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台沒有啟用 iCloud Drive，備份功能停用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud Drive is not enabled on this Mac; backup is disabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台沒有啟用 iCloud Drive，備份功能停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台用哪些 → 依設備": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What this Mac uses → per device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台的設定已備份（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Mac's settings backed up (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選 **Shuffle All** 就會隨機輪播全部影片；想固定一支就直接點那支。隨機的切換頻率（喚醒時／5 分鐘／每天…）也在同一個畫面選。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick **Shuffle All** to rotate through every video at random, or click one video to keep it fixed. The shuffle frequency (on wake / every 5 minutes / daily…) is set on the same screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選 **Shuffle All** 就會隨機輪播全部影片；想固定一支就直接點那支。隨機的切換頻率（喚醒時／5 分鐘／每天…）也在同一個畫面選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選一個來源": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select a source"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選一個來源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選單列也有，⇧⌘N": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also in the menu bar, ⇧⌘N"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選單列也有，⇧⌘N"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選擇要當桌布來源的資料夾": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose folders to use as wallpaper sources"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇要當桌布來源的資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒填網址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No URL yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒填網址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有任何來源。到「來源」分頁加入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No sources yet. Add them in the Sources tab."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有任何來源。到「來源」分頁加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒測試過。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not tested yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒測試過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒解析過。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not resolved yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒解析過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還要一道系統授權": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs one more system permission"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還要一道系統授權"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "那是執行狀態不是設定，跨機同步只會讓兩台互相打斷輪替。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That's runtime state, not a setting; syncing it would just make two Macs interrupt each other's rotation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "部分允許": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "limited"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分允許"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重掃來源資料夾，然後整批重抽——剛丟進來的新片會在這時候出現": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rescans the source folders and redraws the whole batch — videos you just dropped in show up here"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重掃來源資料夾，然後整批重抽——剛丟進來的新片會在這時候出現"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新解析": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resolve Again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新解析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鑰匙串那關沒過": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keychain access was refused"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鑰匙串那關沒過"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟 Immich 說明文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Immich documentation"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 Immich 說明文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟系統設定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟系統設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開著的話，這台的來源一改就寫上去，別台也會自動跟上；同一輪裡兩邊都改過就**以 iCloud 上那份為準**——沒有合併，後寫的贏。桌布設定只會**往上備份**，不會自動套到別台。只想要單向搬家的話，用上面兩顆按鈕就好。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this on, a change to this Mac's sources is written out at once and the other Macs follow. If both sides changed in the same round, **the copy on iCloud wins** — there's no merge, last write wins. Wallpaper settings are only **backed up**; they're never applied to another Mac automatically. For a one-way move, just use the two buttons above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "間隔": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interval"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "電池": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Battery"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "電池"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要 yt-dlp": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "yt-dlp required"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要 yt-dlp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要「照片」授權": {
